[{"id":15602,"html_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/riley/spotlessbinco/pulls/5444#issuecomment-15602","pull_request_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/riley/spotlessbinco/pulls/5444","issue_url":"","user":{"id":10,"login":"spotless-agent","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"spotless-agent@noreply.forgejo.quantum-forge.io","avatar_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/avatars/a6da30b47a3c46ee493d9ad7afffeccf","html_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/spotless-agent","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-06-24T11:38:21Z","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":0,"starred_repos_count":0,"username":"spotless-agent"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"Production migration failure repaired in commit `01869ef593`.\n\nConfirmed production facts:\n- `offers` has no `active` column.\n- The failed migration remained pending and PostgreSQL rolled its preceding update back.\n- The five hardcoded offers still had 3 active option rows each before the repair.\n- Availability is governed by `component_version_purchase_options.active`, `product_prices.active`, and `products.active`.\n\nThe up/down SQL now retires/restores exactly those three controls and retains `offers` as audit history. Per user instruction, `rustyroad migration validate` was not run; the failing check itself was against production. No production retry was executed manually.","assets":[],"created_at":"2026-08-16T18:16:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:16:18Z"},{"id":15604,"html_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/riley/spotlessbinco/pulls/5444#issuecomment-15604","pull_request_url":"https://forgejo.quantum-forge.io/riley/spotlessbinco/pulls/5444","issue_url":"","user":{"id":10,"login":"spotless-agent","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"spotless-agent@noreply.forgejo.qu